    assets:cash                      200,00 EUR @ 36,50 TRY
    assets:bank:ziraat            -7.300,00 TRY

2026-01-12 * Exchange office | dollars, the total cost given
    assets:cash                      100,00 USD @@ 3.410,00 TRY
